ksu etsiv\u00e4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8drsfVZ5EW0Q7kNvwErbTLR&_nc_oc=AdqM-fIvjHaK904TgCYctY1OGcSHLdq6-PkdHG-XWDAVNyKa_5Id4AxMgyljlmWKFus&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEGNVQbjkHn_ZoZAV5tkWb0mB5btBIvmoBjCss6oWE8Mg&oe=6A8EE454"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W0qvluaoOIYQ7kNvwELghlQ&_nc_oc=Adqzwc-YVtMSZBaFLTPRFdhX5rzCBrP8JA5EHvaRvJJOw_t4_EP-cN3G9K1sV51rLEU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFGRhl213GGRhNzw0L1FOyDud-DbYiGopxSU6nj2Wx6nQ&oe=6A8EE932"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t9sARUnMlVgQ7kNvwE2XDBy&_nc_oc=Ado99T74EOSnUoYVtFdyqBSaj_f-cqVipzZMCH5X_gR1js0I8uc2qhk6WcpR9Qy4Jgo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG4xh67vGzEWJRC5e9ipOH4mzout08MhAidic0jrYQLAA&oe=6A8EBE95"}, {"file_name":